<title>BELGIUM: Belgian net debt totalled 9,706.9 bln bfr in Feb.</title>
<headline>Belgian net debt totalled 9,706.9 bln bfr in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released the following data on the state's debt - (in bln francs)</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-Feb   change in mth  change in 1997</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     6,950.5   -14.7		-48.3</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies   672.1    -8.1		+13.5</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     1,924.7    +2.3	     +134.4</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies    89.9   +14.8		+14.5</p>
<p>    net debt		 9,706.9   +38.1	     +178.4</p>
<p>    net borrowing requirement	+31.4	     +146.1</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
